  <data name="Text_InkPseudoIntro" xml:space="preserve"><value>As an additional measure to smooth text in Edit controls, set halo levels around symbols: radius is the halo size; intensity is how much the halo shows through. Note that this option affects text rendering performance. Disabled by default.</value></data>
